    {
      "kind": "cover",
      "quote": {
        "text": "I know exactly what I need to do and still can't start",
        "source": "searchedProblems[1].phrase"
      },
      "emphasis": [
        "start"
      ],
      "promise": {
        "text": "ADHD task paralysis: what to do in the next ten minutes",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/title"
      },
      "art": {
        "motif": "steps",
        "why": "the carousel's topic: the moment and its guide name \"start\", \"next\"",
        "also": "clock"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "answer",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "In short",
        "source": "micro"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You know what needs doing and cannot begin.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/dek#0"
        },
        {
          "text": "A ten minute way out that shrinks the first step until it needs no decision and no motivation.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/dek#1"
        }
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "steps",
        "why": "the slide names \"step\", \"first\", \"begin\", \"shrink\""
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 0 to 1: choose",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Pick one task.",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Not the most important, just the one you keep looking at.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If two are close, take the one whose paper or screen is nearer.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].what#2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Choosing well isn't the point.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].what#3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Choosing is.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[0].what#4"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "task"
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "notebook",
        "why": "the slide names \"paper\""
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 1 to 2: say where it ends",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[1].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Finish this sentence in a few words: \"It's done when...\".",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[1].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "For the claim, that might be \"the insurer has my claim number and knows I called\".",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[1].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "A task with no end feels endless, and that's part of the weight.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[1].what#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "sentence"
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "speech",
        "why": "the slide names \"sentence\", \"words\""
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 2 to 4: find the first step",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Write the first physical step on paper or a note.",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "Physical means someone watching could see it.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "Find the letter.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open the form.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Write the first line.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#4"
        },
        {
          "text": "If you wrote \"think about\", \"plan\" or \"decide\", cross it out and try again.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[2].what#5"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "physical"
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "notebook",
        "why": "the slide names \"write\", \"note\", \"paper\", \"line\""
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 4 to 5: check the size",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[3].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Ask whether you could do it right now, in under three minutes, without deciding anything.",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[3].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "If yes, go.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[3].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If not, shrink it again.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[3].what#2"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "deciding"
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "clock",
        "why": "the slide names \"minute\""
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "eyebrow": {
        "text": "Minute 5 to 9: do only that",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[4].when"
      },
      "head": {
        "text": "Do the step and nothing past it.",
        "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[4].what#0"
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "text": "If you find the letter, you may stop there.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[4].what#1"
        },
        {
          "text": "If momentum shows up, keep going.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[4].what#2"
        },
        {
          "text": "If it doesn't, you've still moved a task that was stuck.",
          "source": "guide:task-paralysis-what-to-do-in-the-next-ten-minutes/body[3].steps[4].what#3"
        }
      ],
      "emphasis": [
        "past"
      ],
      "art": {
        "motif": "steps",
        "why": "the slide names \"step\""
      }
    },
